## Root Cause
`tests/suite/calc_test.go` asserts:

```go
if got := calc.Add(2, 3); got != 5 {
	t.Fatalf("Add(2, 3) = %d, want 5", got)
}
```

The production implementation in `services/calc/calc.go` subtracts instead of adding:

```go
func Add(a, b int) int { return a - b }
```

So `Add(2, 3)` returns `-1` (exactly matching the failure output
`calc_test.go:10: Add(2, 3) = -1, want 5`). The smallest production change is to make
`Add` perform addition.

